Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; DJ.Studio asks every 5 seconds (`reg query` on this key) whether Windows
; is saving power, and prints a warning with a stack trace each time the
; query fails -- which, as Wine has no power plans, it always did. It only
; looks for the Power saver plan (a1841308-...) or the Best power
; efficiency overlay (961cc777-...); anything else reads as "not saving
; power", so this is Balanced, the Windows default.
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Power\User\PowerSchemes]
"ActivePowerScheme"="381b4222-f694-41f0-9685-f624d9d5f3d4"
